.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B HEE_CRED_DIR
Absolute path to the secrets store, overriding the relative default
.IR .hee/secrets .
Set it in
.I heerc
to pin one store per machine;
.B \-dir
still wins when given.
.TP
.B HEE_CRED_AGE_IDENTITY
The age identity file used to open
.B .age
credentials when
.B \-identity
is not given.
.TP
.B HEE_CRED_PASS
Set in the child's environment by
.B \-pass
and
.BR \-run .
.TP
.B HEE_CRED_TTY
The device checked for age's passphrase prompt (default
.IR /dev/tty ).
For the test suite, whose stand\-in age never prompts; nothing else
should set it.
.TP
.B HEE_GITHUB_APPS
The GitHub App registry, when
.B \-registry
is not given.
.TP
.B GH_TOKEN
Set in the child's environment by
.BR \-github\-token ,
unless
.B \-as
names another variable.
.TP
.B HEE_GITHUB_API
The GitHub REST API root (default
.IR https://api.github.com ).
For the test suite's local stand\-in; nothing else should set it.
